{ ================================================================================
  S3_S - VOLATILITY SQUEEZE SHORT STRATEGY
  Signal Name : S3_VolSqueezeShort
  MC Load Name: STRATEGY_GEN_S3_VolSqueezeShort
  Version     : v1.9.0-EXPERIMENTAL  (2026-07-01 - Data1=1M architecture rewrite)
                Base: v1.8.0-PROD (live_simulation proven: 24 trades / Net +846K / PF 4.13)
                Architecture: Data1=1M, Data2=60M, Data3=Daily
                Goal: SP/SL stop orders fill at 1M resolution, eliminating Bug 2
                      (60M intrabar stop slippage, e.g. BoJ trade -132K)
                Entry/TP/Mid/TimeStop maintain 60M decision logic via Data2
                IOG removed (Data1=1M provides native 1M bar resolution)
                BWRank rewritten to circular buffer (60M-resolution history on 1M Data1)
  Symbol      : TXF1 (Taiwan Stock Index Futures Front Month)
  Platform    : MultiCharts 12 PowerLanguage x64
  Timeframe   : Data1 = 1M (execution) + Data2 = 60M (decision/indicators) + Data3 = Daily (regime)
  Class       : Volatility Regime (C class) - Short only (Rule R-6 split)
  Direction   : Short only

  v1.8.2 PROVEN FAILED (2026-06-30):
    IOG=true approach cannot achieve 1M stop resolution.
    MC12 "next bar at Market" ALWAYS fills at next Data1 bar regardless of IOG.
    Backtest: all SP exits on 60M boundaries, BoJ trade still -132K.
    Root cause: platform-level constraint, not code logic.

  v1.9.0 SOLUTION:
    Swap Data1 to 1M so "next bar" IS the next 1M bar.
    Stop orders (SP/SL) fill at 1M resolution - no Bug 2.
    60M decision logic preserved via BarStatus(2)=2 gate + Data2 references.
    BWRank uses circular buffer array (BW_History) updated at 60M bar close.
    All parameter VALUES unchanged from v1.8.0-PROD.

  DATA MAPPING CHANGE:
    Slot   v1.8.0 (old)              v1.9.0 (new)
    Data1  60M (entry/indicators)    1M  (execution timeframe)
    Data2  Daily (regime filter)     60M (decision/indicators)
    Data3  1M (exit monitor)         Daily (regime filter)

  CHART SETUP REQUIRED:
    Data1 = TXF1 1M
    Data2 = TXF1 60M
    Data3 = TXF1 Daily
    MaxBarsBack >= 1000 (covers Daily MA50 via Data3)

  CHANGELOG:
    v1.9.0 (2026-07-01): Data1=1M architecture rewrite
         - Data slot rotation: 1M promoted to Data1, 60M to Data2, Daily to Data3
         - IOG removed (IntrabarOrderGeneration = False)
         - All IntraBarPersist qualifiers removed (not needed without IOG)
         - BB/ATR indicators: function() of Data2 syntax for 60M resolution
         - BWRank: circular buffer BW_History[150] replaces v_BandWidth[v_i] lookback
         - Entry gate: BarStatus(2)=2 for 60M bar close timing
         - Mid/TimeStop: BarStatus(2)=2 + Close of Data2 + BarNumber of Data2
         - 1M monitoring: of Data3 removed (Data1 is now 1M natively)
         - SP/SL stop orders: fill at next 1M bar (Bug 2 eliminated)
         - P0 market exits: fill at next 1M bar (faster safety response)
         - Parameter values: ZERO changes from v1.8.0-PROD

    v1.8.0 (2026-06-29): [see v1.8.0-PROD header for full history]

  ALPHA THESIS: [unchanged from v1.8.0]
  PARAMETERIZATION: [unchanged - all values from v1.8.0-PROD]
  CONSTITUTION COMPLIANCE: [unchanged]
  LABEL CONVENTIONS: [unchanged]

  STATUS: v1.9.0 EXPERIMENTAL - Data1=1M architecture, pending backtest validation.
================================================================================ }

[IntrabarOrderGeneration = False]


{ ============================================================
  SECTION 1 - INPUTS
  ALL values identical to v1.8.0-PROD. No parameter changes.
  ============================================================ }

inputs:
    { ===== Bollinger Bands (core squeeze detection) - v1.2 defaults ===== }
    BBLen                     ( 45    ),
    BBStd                     ( 2.0   ),
    BWLookback                ( 120   ),
    BWPctile                  ( 25    ),

    { ===== ATR (stop / target anchor) - v1.2 defaults ===== }
    ATR_Len                   ( 14    ),
    StopATRMult               ( 2.75  ),
    TargetATRMult             ( 3.5   ),

    { ===== Exit timing - v1.2 defaults ===== }
    MaxBars                   ( 35    ),
    UseMidExit                ( True  ),
    MidExit_MinBars           ( 2     ),

    { ===== Layer 2: Trailing StopProfit (v1.1) ===== }
    SP_Trigger_ATRMult        ( 1.5   ),
    SP_Retain_Pct             ( 70    ),

    { ===== Same-day cooldown ===== }
    Cooldown_Days             ( 1     ),

    { ===== Regime Filter (Daily via Data3) ===== }
    Use_Regime_Filter         ( True  ),
    Regime_FastMA             ( 15    ),
    Regime_SlowMA             ( 40    ),
    Regime_BlockRange         ( True  ),
    Regime_BlockWeakBull      ( True  ),

    { ===== Priority 0 Protection (Rule #11 / #12) ===== }
    Holiday_Flat_Time         ( 415   ),
    Registry_Valid_Until      ( 1270101 ),
    Manual_Kill_Switch        ( False ),
    Settlement_Flat_Time      ( 1230  ),

    { ===== Multi-Layer 1M Exit Monitoring (now native on Data1) ===== }
    ML_ActivationPct          ( 30    ),
    ML_ScoreTrigger           ( 30    ),
    ML_MinCategories          ( 3     ),
    ML_VolSpikeMult           ( 1.5   ),
    ML_VolAvgLen              ( 15    ),
    ML_SpeedBars              ( 5     ),
    ML_SpeedThreshPts         ( 30    ),
    ML_ATR_Short_Len          ( 3     ),
    ML_ATR_Long_Len           ( 90    ),
    ML_ATR_Ratio              ( 2.5   );


